   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The -s passive",
     "texto": [
      "It's formed by adding **-s** to the right form: **sælges** (is sold), **købes** (is bought), **åbnes** (is opened). In the past there are forms like **byggedes**, but the passive with **blev + participle** is usually more natural in ordinary narrative: **Huset blev bygget i 1950.** The -s passive is common in rules, adverts and formal registers."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Without «af»",
     "texto": [
      "With the -s passive, the doer of the action is almost never stated. Compare: **Huset byggedes i 1950.** = The house was built in 1950.",
      "If you want to say who did it, use another form: **Huset blev bygget af en arkitekt.** = The house was built by an architect."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
